    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Welcome to Tretrais: The Battle for Survival on Mars Begins!</strong><br>Tretrais is an action-packed survival and base-building game set on the surface of Mars in a distant future. After your spaceship crashes due to a malfunction, you are the only survivor. You must build a base to sustain life in harsh conditions and fend off enemy waves that begin every night at 9:00 PM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Enemy Variety</strong><br>Each night\u2019s attacks will challenge you not only in numbers but in diversity. From leaping creatures to explosive enemies, ranged attackers to heavily armored beasts \u2014 each enemy type demands different strategies and defensive setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Weapons and Upgrade Systems</strong><br>Tretrais starts you off with four main weapons that automatically target the nearest enemy. But shooting alone won't save you. You can upgrade your weapons to improve damage, range, fire rate, and add special effects like burning, freezing, or electrifying. Choose combinations that match your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Traps and Turrets to Strengthen Your Defense</strong><br>When your weapons aren\u2019t enough, traps and turrets come into play. Place spike traps, slowing mud, and explosive mines to halt enemies in their tracks. Surround your base with auto-firing turrets to build a strong defensive perimeter. Smart placement can be a lifesaver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explorable Map and Hidden Areas</strong><br>Survival is only part of the mission \u2014 exploration awaits! Discover new areas, collect resources, investigate abandoned structures, and follow mysterious signals to unlock surprise quests. Beneath the red surface of Mars, remnants of the past are waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8d8cf5b27b28a21abdb47b4eaa9db9a6.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8d8cf5b27b28a21abdb47b4eaa9db9a6.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Co-op Mode: Survive Together</strong><br>Not a fan of going solo? Good news! Tretrais supports online co-op mode, so you can team up with friends. Build your base together, share resources, and fight off enemy waves side by side. Strategic teamwork becomes crucial as the days go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are You Ready?</strong><br>You\u2019re alone on Mars \u2014 but not helpless. Rise from the wreckage, build your base, arm yourself, and survive the nightly threats at 9:00 PM!<br>Tretrais will test your reflexes, intelligence, and determination. It's time to write your own story on the red planet.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Welcome to Tretrais: The Battle for Survival on Mars Begins!</strong><br>Tretrais is an action-packed survival and base-building game set on the surface of Mars in a distant future. After your spaceship crashes due to a malfunction, you are the only survivor. You must build a base to sustain life in harsh conditions and fend off enemy waves that begin every night at 9:00 PM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Enemy Variety</strong><br>Each night\u2019s attacks will challenge you not only in numbers but in diversity. From leaping creatures to explosive enemies, ranged attackers to heavily armored beasts \u2014 each enemy type demands different strategies and defensive setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Weapons and Upgrade Systems</strong><br>Tretrais starts you off with four main weapons that automatically target the nearest enemy. But shooting alone won't save you. You can upgrade your weapons to improve damage, range, fire rate, and add special effects like burning, freezing, or electrifying. Choose combinations that match your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Traps and Turrets to Strengthen Your Defense</strong><br>When your weapons aren\u2019t enough, traps and turrets come into play. Place spike traps, slowing mud, and explosive mines to halt enemies in their tracks. Surround your base with auto-firing turrets to build a strong defensive perimeter. Smart placement can be a lifesaver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explorable Map and Hidden Areas</strong><br>Survival is only part of the mission \u2014 exploration awaits! Discover new areas, collect resources, investigate abandoned structures, and follow mysterious signals to unlock surprise quests. Beneath the red surface of Mars, remnants of the past are waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8d8cf5b27b28a21abdb47b4eaa9db9a6.poster.avif?t=1754642381\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8d8cf5b27b28a21abdb47b4eaa9db9a6.webm?t=1754642381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Co-op Mode: Survive Together</strong><br>Not a fan of going solo? Good news! Tretrais supports online co-op mode, so you can team up with friends. Build your base together, share resources, and fight off enemy waves side by side. Strategic teamwork becomes crucial as the days go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are You Ready?</strong><br>You\u2019re alone on Mars \u2014 but not helpless. Rise from the wreckage, build your base, arm yourself, and survive the nightly threats at 9:00 PM!<br>Tretrais will test your reflexes, intelligence, and determination. It's time to write your own story on the red planet.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tretrais is a survival and defense-focused action game set on Mars. As an astronaut stranded in the wreckage of a crashed ship, build shelters, craft weapons, and fight off waves of enemies every night!",
